      <cyrillic>тэгэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TEGE-</transcript>
      <definition>2 [= cinggi-] v. t. To do so, thus, or that way.</definition>
      <page>792</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠪᠡᠴᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--becy</transcript>
          <definition> In spite of that.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠪᠡᠰᠦ = ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠪᠡᠯ</unicode>
          <transcript>--besy = --bel</transcript>
          <definition> Then; if so; in such case.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠪᠡᠰᠦ ᠪᠢ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠶ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>--besy bi jabuj-a</transcript>
          <definition> If so, I shall go.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠭᠡᠳ</unicode>
          <transcript>--ged</transcript>
          <definition> See separate entry.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠶ᠎ᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>--j-e</transcript>
          <definition> Let us do it that way; let it be that way; all right then!.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠵᠦ ᠺᠢᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zu kiky</transcript>
          <definition> To do it thus or so.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
